WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.836
A common denominator names equal-sized parts. Multiply numerator and denominator

00:00:04.836 --> 00:00:07.155
together by the same scale.

00:00:08.033 --> 00:00:16.197
Complete: 1/4 equals ?/20. The answer is 5. Multiply numerator and denominator by 5:

00:00:16.197 --> 00:00:16.780
5/20.

00:00:17.617 --> 00:00:23.158
A recipe fraction at a school fair is 1/6. What is an equivalent fraction with

00:00:23.158 --> 00:00:25.745
denominator 18? Pause the video and think.

00:00:26.617 --> 00:00:33.108
A recipe fraction at a school fair is 1/6. What is an equivalent fraction with

00:00:33.108 --> 00:00:38.734
denominator 18? The answer is 3. Multiply numerator and denominator by 3: 3/18.
